                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.6363 Barco/80: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Piles</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-03-17T13:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 17,
                                1928—1 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>13. Report briefly by cable present status of Barco case and endeavor to expedite
                    decision promised within a month, as reported in your 11, February 17, 4
                        p.m.<anchor n="9" xml:id="d617-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
